= September 2020 — The court supplies the missing act

The first certified result was blocked. A Supreme Court panel whose own status
is contested now declares the election invalid, the one institutional act
that can trigger a new ballot under Article 129. PiS calls the sequence lawful;
Trzaskowski calls it jurisdiction manufactured after the fact.

Witek may exercise acting powers only until the repeat process produces a
President; she does not inherit a term and cannot shorten the Sejm's term. We
must decide whether our campaign defends the first result, rebuilds the
democratic coalition or refuses a ballot born from the interregnum.

- @repeat_defend
- @repeat_broaden
- @repeat_withdraw

@repeat_defend
title: Campaign on the certified result and constitutional theft
subtitle: Make the blocked oath the issue, even as the right builds a grievance of its own.
on-arrival: trz_repeat_campaign_score += 5; trz_right_backlash += 3; constitutional_restraint += 3; news_headline = "Trzaskowski makes the blocked oath the rerun's central issue"

We put the first certificate on every platform and force PiS to defend the
interregnum. Democratic voters recover a clear cause; the right converts the
same campaign into proof that the opposition will never accept it.

