@tribunal_showdown
# prose-audit: Grade A — Przyłębska, Lempart, Kotula and affected patients anchor Lewica's choice, and every strategy retains a distinct political aftermath before returning to the table.
title: War of the Powers II — the Tribunal
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
